{"seq":1,"slug":"progressive-migration-patterns","title":"渐进式迁移模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/architecture-evolution/progressive-migration-patterns","wordCount":1185,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"渐进式迁移模式\">渐进式迁移模式</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>前端架构迁移中最危险的策略是&quot;大爆炸重写&quot;——暂停业务开发数月，用全新技术栈重建整个应用。历史数据表明超过 70% 的大重写项目延期或失败。渐进式迁移则相反：在持续交付业务价值的同时，逐步用新架构替代旧实现，直到旧代码被完全淘汰。本文总结从 SPA 到 SSR/Islands、从 Webpack 到 Rspack/Vite、从整体式到微前端的典型迁移路径，以及 Strangler Fig 模式、路由级灰度等经过验证的迁移策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"strangler-fig-模式\">Strangler Fig 模式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Phase 1: Coexistence&quot;&#10;        A[&quot;Old SPA&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Router intercepts new routes&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;New SSR pages&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; D[&quot;Old routes remain unchanged&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Phase 2: Gradual Replacement&quot;&#10;        E[&quot;More routes migrated&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;Old routes shrinking&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Phase 3: Complete&quot;&#10;        G[&quot;All routes on new architecture&quot;]&#10;        H[&quot;Old code removed&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"Phase 1: Coexistence\"\n        A[\"Old SPA\"] --&gt; B[\"Router intercepts new routes\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"New SSR pages\"]\n        B --&gt; D[\"Old routes remain unchanged\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Phase 2: Gradual Replacement\"\n        E[\"More routes migrated\"] --&gt; F[\"Old routes shrinking\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Phase 3: Complete\"\n        G[\"All routes on new architecture\"]\n        H[\"Old code removed\"]\n    end</pre><p>命名来自热带的绞杀榕——新系统包裹旧系统生长，最终完全替代，旧系统自然消亡。关键原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>新旧系统共存运行，新功能在新架构中实现</li>\n<li>通过路由层控制流量分配，对用户无感知</li>\n<li>旧系统不再接收新功能，仅维护修复</li>\n<li>迁移进度可量化（已迁移路由数/总路由数）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"三类典型迁移\">三类典型迁移</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>迁移类型</th>\n<th>从</th>\n<th>到</th>\n<th>典型耗时</th>\n<th>风险级别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>渲染模式</td>\n<td>CSR SPA</td>\n<td>SSR/Islands</td>\n<td>3-6 月</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建工具</td>\n<td>Webpack 4/5</td>\n<td>Rspack/Vite</td>\n<td>1-4 周</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用架构</td>\n<td>Monolith</td>\n<td>微前端</td>\n<td>6-12 月</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"迁移路径-1-spa-ssr-islands\">迁移路径 1：SPA → SSR/Islands</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 阶段 1: 在现有 SPA 外围包裹 Astro/Next.js 壳&#10;// next.config.js - 新旧共存&#10;module.exports = {&#10;  async rewrites() {&#10;    return [&#10;      // 已迁移的路由走 Next.js&#10;      { source: &#39;/blog/:path*&#39;, destination: &#39;/blog/:path*&#39; },&#10;      { source: &#39;/docs/:path*&#39;, destination: &#39;/docs/:path*&#39; },&#10;      // 未迁移的路由代理到旧 SPA&#10;      {&#10;        source: &#39;/:path*&#39;,&#10;        destination: &#39;http://localhost:3001/:path*&#39;, // 旧 SPA dev server&#10;      },&#10;    ];&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 阶段 1: 在现有 SPA 外围包裹 Astro/Next.js 壳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// next.config.js - 新旧共存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exports</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rewrites</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 已迁移的路由走 Next.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { source: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/blog/:path*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, destination: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/blog/:path*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { source: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/docs/:path*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, destination: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/docs/:path*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 未迁移的路由代理到旧 SPA</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        source: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/:path*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        destination: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://localhost:3001/:path*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 旧 SPA dev server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 阶段 2: 将旧 SPA 作为 Next.js 的一个 client-only 路由&#10;// app/app/[[...slug]]/page.tsx&#10;&#39;use client&#39;;&#10;import { LegacySPA } from &#39;@/legacy/LegacySPA&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default function LegacyAppRoute() {&#10;  return &lt;LegacySPA /&gt;;&#10;}&#10;// 逐步将旧 SPA 中的页面迁移为 Next.js Server Components\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 阶段 2: 将旧 SPA 作为 Next.js 的一个 client-only 路由</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/app/[[...slug]]/page.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'use client'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { LegacySPA } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@/legacy/LegacySPA'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LegacyAppRoute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LegacySPA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 逐步将旧 SPA 中的页面迁移为 Next.js Server Components</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 阶段 3: 共享认证和状态&#10;// 旧 SPA 和新 SSR 页面之间通过 Cookie/Token 共享会话&#10;// middleware.ts&#10;import { NextResponse } from &#39;next/server&#39;;&#10;import type { NextRequest } from &#39;next/server&#39;;&#10;&#10;export function middleware(request: NextRequest) {&#10;  const token = request.cookies.get(&#39;auth-token&#39;);&#10;  if (!token &amp;&amp; request.nextUrl.pathname.startsWith(&#39;/dashboard&#39;)) {&#10;    return NextResponse.redirect(new URL(&#39;/login&#39;, request.url));&#10;  }&#10;  return NextResponse.next();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 阶段 3: 共享认证和状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 旧 SPA 和新 SSR 页面之间通过 Cookie/Token 共享会话</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// middleware.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { NextResponse } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'next/server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { NextRequest } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'next/server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> middleware</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NextRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> token</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.cookies.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'auth-token'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.nextUrl.pathname.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/dashboard'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NextResponse.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">redirect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/login'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, request.url));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NextResponse.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"迁移路径-2-webpack-rspack\">迁移路径 2：Webpack → Rspack</h3><p>Rspack 提供了与 Webpack 高度兼容的 API，迁移通常在 1-4 周内完成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 步骤 1: 安装 Rspack&#10;// npm install @rspack/core @rspack/cli -D&#10;&#10;// 步骤 2: 重命名配置文件&#10;// webpack.config.js → rspack.config.ts&#10;&#10;// 步骤 3: 替换不兼容的 loader/plugin&#10;// rspack.config.ts&#10;import { defineConfig } from &#39;@rspack/cli&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  module: {&#10;    rules: [&#10;      {&#10;        test: /\\.(ts|tsx)$/,&#10;        // 替换: babel-loader → builtin:swc-loader (内置，更快)&#10;        use: {&#10;          loader: &#39;builtin:swc-loader&#39;,&#10;          options: {&#10;            jsc: {&#10;              parser: { syntax: &#39;typescript&#39;, tsx: true },&#10;              transform: { react: { runtime: &#39;automatic&#39; } },&#10;            },&#10;          },&#10;        },&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;  },&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    // 大部分 Webpack 插件可直接复用&#10;    // 不兼容的替换为 Rspack 内置能力&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 步骤 1: 安装 Rspack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npm install @rspack/core @rspack/cli -D</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 步骤 2: 重命名配置文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// webpack.config.js → rspack.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 步骤 3: 替换不兼容的 loader/plugin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// rspack.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@rspack/cli'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  module: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rules: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        test:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(ts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">tsx)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 替换: babel-loader → builtin:swc-loader (内置，更快)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        use: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          loader: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'builtin:swc-loader'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          options: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            jsc: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              parser: { syntax: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'typescript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, tsx: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              transform: { react: { runtime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'automatic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 大部分 Webpack 插件可直接复用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 不兼容的替换为 Rspack 内置能力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>常见不兼容点及解决方案</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Webpack 功能</th>\n<th>Rspack 替代</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>babel-loader</td>\n<td>builtin:swc-loader</td>\n<td>内置 SWC，10x 更快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>css-loader + mini-css-extract</td>\n<td>experiments.css</td>\n<td>原生 CSS 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>thread-loader</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>Rspack 本身多线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HMR (custom)</td>\n<td>内置 HMR</td>\n<td>开箱即用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Module Federation</td>\n<td>@module-federation/enhanced</td>\n<td>同 API，直接迁移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"迁移路径-3-monolith-微前端\">迁移路径 3：Monolith → 微前端</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Phase 1: Identify boundaries&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Phase 2: Extract shared modules&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Phase 3: First remote app&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Phase 4: Gradual extraction&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Phase 5: Full federation&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Phase 1: Identify boundaries\"] --&gt; B[\"Phase 2: Extract shared modules\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Phase 3: First remote app\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Phase 4: Gradual extraction\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Phase 5: Full federation\"]</pre><p><strong>阶段 1</strong>：识别团队边界和功能边界，确定第一个待抽取的子应用（选择变更频率最高、团队职责最清晰的模块）。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 2</strong>：提取共享基础设施（设计系统、API 客户端、认证逻辑）为独立包。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 3</strong>：将第一个功能模块抽取为独立构建的远程应用，通过 Module Federation 集成回 Shell。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 4</strong>：逐步抽取更多模块，每次只迁移一个功能域。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 5</strong>：旧 monolith 缩减为纯 Shell + 路由，所有功能都在独立远程中运行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"迁移安全网\">迁移安全网</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>功能开关（Feature Flags）</strong>：每个迁移路由都通过 Feature Flag 控制，可随时回滚</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 路由级功能开关&#10;const routes = [&#10;  {&#10;    path: &#39;/products&#39;,&#10;    component: featureFlags.isEnabled(&#39;new-product-page&#39;)&#10;      ? NewProductPage // 新架构&#10;      : LegacyProductPage, // 旧实现&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 路由级功能开关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> routes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/products'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    component: featureFlags.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isEnabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'new-product-page'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NewProductPage </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 新架构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LegacyProductPage, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 旧实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><ol start=\"2\">\n<li><p><strong>并行运行验证</strong>：新旧页面同时渲染（shadow mode），对比输出差异</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>渐进式流量切换</strong>：从 1% → 10% → 50% → 100% 逐步放量</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>监控告警</strong>：新架构页面的 Core Web Vitals 不低于旧页面（LCP 回归 &gt; 200ms 自动回滚）</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"迁移优先级评估矩阵\">迁移优先级评估矩阵</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>高优先迁移</th>\n<th>低优先迁移</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>变更频率</td>\n<td>每周多次修改</td>\n<td>几个月不动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能收益</td>\n<td>LCP &gt; 3s，迁移后 &lt; 1.5s</td>\n<td>性能已满足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队痛点</td>\n<td>构建慢、依赖冲突</td>\n<td>开发体验良好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务影响</td>\n<td>核心转化流程</td>\n<td>低流量页面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术难度</td>\n<td>独立、少依赖</td>\n<td>深度耦合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"避免迁移反模式\">避免迁移反模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大爆炸重写</td>\n<td>停滞业务交付 6+ 月</td>\n<td>Strangler Fig 渐进替换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迁移 AND 重构</td>\n<td>同时做太多，无法定位问题</td>\n<td>先迁移（行为等价），再优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忽视测试覆盖</td>\n<td>迁移后无法验证功能正确性</td>\n<td>迁移前补充 E2E 测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全量切换无回滚</td>\n<td>问题时无法快速恢复</td>\n<td>Feature Flag + 灰度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享状态迁移</td>\n<td>新旧系统状态不同步</td>\n<td>先统一状态管理层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>迁移场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>next-on-pages</td>\n<td>Next.js → Cloudflare</td>\n<td>渲染模式迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@codemod/cli</td>\n<td>AST 级代码自动转换</td>\n<td>API 变更批量处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rspack compat mode</td>\n<td>Webpack → Rspack</td>\n<td>构建工具迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>single-spa parcels</td>\n<td>嵌入子应用</td>\n<td>微前端渐进拆分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Playwright E2E</td>\n<td>视觉回归检测</td>\n<td>迁移前后对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LaunchDarkly / Unleash</td>\n<td>Feature Flags</td>\n<td>灰度发布控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>成功的前端架构迁移遵循一个核心原则：<strong>每一步都是可部署的、可回滚的、对用户透明的</strong>。Strangler Fig 模式是实现这一原则的最佳框架——新系统在旧系统周围生长，通过路由层控制流量，从最小切面开始验证新架构的可行性。迁移速度取决于三个因素：测试覆盖率（决定回归信心）、Feature Flag 粒度（决定回滚速度）、监控灵敏度（决定问题发现时间）。将架构迁移视为持续进行的日常工作，而非一次性的&quot;项目&quot;——这种心态转变是渐进式迁移成功的根本保障。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"渐进式迁移模式","id":"渐进式迁移模式"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"Strangler Fig 模式","id":"strangler-fig-模式"},{"level":3,"text":"三类典型迁移","id":"三类典型迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"迁移路径 1：SPA → SSR/Islands","id":"迁移路径-1-spa-ssr-islands"},{"level":3,"text":"迁移路径 2：Webpack → Rspack","id":"迁移路径-2-webpack-rspack"},{"level":3,"text":"迁移路径 3：Monolith → 微前端","id":"迁移路径-3-monolith-微前端"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"迁移安全网","id":"迁移安全网"},{"level":3,"text":"迁移优先级评估矩阵","id":"迁移优先级评估矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"避免迁移反模式","id":"避免迁移反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"远程组件加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/federation-and-composition/remote-component-loading"},"next":{"title":"性能驱动架构决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/architecture-evolution/performance-driven-architecture"}}